Issue8689ProjectionLike.agda:28.1-14: error: [UnequalTerms]
The terms
  w
and
  y
are not equal at type Nat
when checking that the type
(x y : Nat) (p : x ≡ y) (j : I) (w : Nat) (g : Nat → Wrap Nat) →
Reveal Nat (unwrap (hcomp (λ i ._ → g y) (g w)))
of the generated with function is well-formed
(https://agda.readthedocs.io/en/v2.10.0/language/with-abstraction.html#ill-typed-with-abstractions)
